        "content": "Daily messages — collected through 2026-09-10T18:50:00-04:00\n\nConversation: imessage | thread-40abd5ae5387be803a2aa919\nParticipants: Me, Devon\n\n[2026-09-10T18:00:00-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\njust walked in the door ugh\n\n[2026-09-10T18:05:11-04:00] Devon\nsame, my bus was late again\n\n[2026-09-10T18:05:19-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\ndid you at least get lunch today?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:10:31-04:00] Devon\nyeah just a sad sandwich lol\n\n[2026-09-10T18:12:04-04:00] Devon\nhey are you still in a pizza mood?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:12:12-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\nalways, why\n\n[2026-09-10T18:12:20-04:00] Devon\nwanna get pizza at Luigi's on Friday?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:17:31-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\noh you mean the one on 5th?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:17:47-04:00] Devon\nyeah that's the one\n\n[2026-09-10T18:19:21-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\nyes I'm down, what time were you thinking?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:19:28-04:00] Devon\n7pm?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:19:36-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\nyeah that works\n\n[2026-09-10T18:19:44-04:00] Devon\ncool I'll meet you there\n\n[2026-09-10T18:19:52-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\nperfect, I'm gonna be a couch potato tonight\n\n[2026-09-10T18:20:00-04:00] Devon\nsame honestly, see you tomorrow\n\nConversation: imessage | thread-568cd4c46cad825d4135531b\nParticipants: Maya, Devon, Me\n\n[2026-09-10T18:30:00-04:00] Maya\nugh traffic getting home tonight was the worst\n\n[2026-09-10T18:37:37-04:00] Maya\nrandom thought tho, anyone want to go see the ducks at the pond Saturday morning?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:39:54-04:00] Devon\nohh yes I haven't done that in forever\n\n[2026-09-10T18:40:17-04:00] Devon\nwhat time were you thinking?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:40:28-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\nhmm maybe, my Saturday is kind of up in the air rn\n\n[2026-09-10T18:40:51-04:00] Maya\nI was thinking like 9am before it gets too hot?\n\n[2026-09-10T18:41:14-04:00] Devon\nyeah that works for me\n\n[2026-09-10T18:42:00-04:00] Me (sent by owner)\n9 is early lol I'll have to see, don't plan around me\n\n[2026-09-10T18:49:37-04:00] Maya\nhaha no worries just lmk\n\n[2026-09-10T18:50:00-04:00] Devon\ndid your guys power flicker earlier or was that just my building",
